      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "With respect to the physical states of the reactants and products there are two types of chemical equilibrium: homogeneous, in which all species are in the same phase, and heterogeneous, in which they are in more than one phase."
          }
        ]
